&lt;p&gt;Integra FEC is hiring entrepreneurial and quantitatively skilled graduates with a background in economics and mathematics who are interested in applying their skills to identify, investigate and analyze fraud in various domains, including finance, healthcare and cryptocurrencies. Integra is a boutique economic consulting and forensic analytics firm that works with government agencies and private entities to analyze complicated and high-profile schemes. Our team applies data science and econometric techniques and intensely values each employee to take initiative and to be curious while operating as a data detective to solve complex problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Main responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working as a data detective to examine potentially fraudulent patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting qualitative and quantitative research to identify opportunities to detect fraud and identify fraud detection methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building, cleaning, compiling and analyzing datasets to find insights and fraud patterns using econometrics, statistics and other forms of analyses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building scripts, algorithms and code to process and analyze large datasets effectively and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenting findings to technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in Economics required, with Finance and Mathematics background a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, SQL, R, or other scripting languages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail with big-picture understanding&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well in teams&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highest ethical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the U.S. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment Visa at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
